{"seq":46,"slug":"autonomous-driving","title":"自动驾驶技术","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"自动驾驶技术\">自动驾驶技术</h1><p>自动驾驶是将感知、决策、控制三大能力集成到一辆车上的系统工程，目标是让机器在复杂开放道路上替代人类完成驾驶任务。2025-2026 年，端到端神经网络取代了传统模块化管线成为主流架构，BEV 感知与 3D 占用网络成为感知栈标配，强化学习与世界模型驱动决策规划大幅进化——这标志着行业从&quot;辅助驾驶&quot;正式跨越至&quot;条件自动化&quot;的临界点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦自动驾驶的<strong>完整技术栈与产业实践</strong>：从传感器融合、BEV 感知、端到端模型到仿真验证与商业化落地。它与同 category 下的兄弟 hub 互补但不重叠：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>图神经网络 hub</strong>（<code>45_graph-neural-networks</code>）侧重图结构学习的通用理论与架构，本 hub 仅在交通场景图建模时引用其消息传递机制。</li>\n<li><strong>概率图模型 hub</strong>（<code>19_probabilistic-graphical-models</code>）提供概率推理基础，本 hub 在行为预测中引用贝叶斯推断思想但不展开推导。</li>\n<li><strong>强化学习 hub</strong>（<code>02_ai-llm/14_reinforcement-learning</code>）覆盖 RL 通用理论，本 hub 仅讨论 RL 在驾驶决策中的工程落地。</li>\n<li><strong>视觉 Transformer hub</strong>（<code>02_ai-llm/83_vision-transformers-architectures</code>）讲 ViT 通用架构，本 hub 聚焦其在 BEV 感知中的特化应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A — 算法工程师</strong>：foundations(1→2→3) → algorithms(1→2→3) → systems(2) → industry(1)</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B — 系统/平台工程师</strong>：foundations(1→2) → systems(1→2→3) → algorithms(2) → industry(3)</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C — 产品/战略视角</strong>：foundations(1) → industry(1→2→3) → algorithms(2) → systems(2)</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>深度学习基础（CNN、Transformer 注意力机制）</li>\n<li>计算机视觉基本概念（目标检测、语义分割）</li>\n<li>线性代数与概率论（坐标变换、贝叶斯推断）</li>\n<li>了解 Python / PyTorch 基本用法（阅读代码片段所需）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"自动驾驶基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ad-levels-architecture","title":"SAE 分级与系统架构演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/foundations/ad-levels-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sensor-fusion-principles","title":"多传感器融合原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/foundations/sensor-fusion-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"datasets-benchmarks","title":"数据集与评测基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/foundations/datasets-benchmarks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bev-perception","title":"BEV 感知与占用网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/bev-perception"},{"seq":2,"slug":"end-to-end-driving","title":"端到端自动驾驶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/end-to-end-driving"},{"seq":3,"slug":"planning-decision","title":"规划与决策算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/planning-decision"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"computing-platforms","title":"车载计算平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/systems/computing-platforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation-validation","title":"仿真验证体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/systems/simulation-validation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"safety-redundancy","title":"功能安全与冗余设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/systems/safety-redundancy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"industry","title":"产业格局","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/industry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"waymo-tesla-comparison","title":"Waymo 与 Tesla 技术路线对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/industry/waymo-tesla-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-autonomous-driving","title":"中国智能驾驶生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/industry/china-autonomous-driving"},{"seq":3,"slug":"robotaxi-commercialization","title":"Robotaxi 商业化与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/industry/robotaxi-commercialization"}]}]}